### Summary

These patches add an `iconOnly` boolean prop and an `icon` node prop to the `Tab` component, apply appropriate **BEM modifier classes** at both individual and Tabs-container level, and ensure Tabs/ContainedTabs pass the `iconOnly` prop down. The presenter (library user) will provide icons when using icon-only tabs, triggering correct rendering and styling. You will need to ensure your SCSS supports the `--icon-only` modifier for the desired layout (matching the designs above).
